  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-建站与落地页\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过此接口实现站点的复制功能，成功后生成一个新站点id，站点内容和原站点一致。使用时需确保传入的 `site_ids` 站点id列表中id的正确性，否则将导致复制全部失败。配合接口有【获取Access-Token】和【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ad.site.copy\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/site/copy/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710623908864\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，获取方法见该接口文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"此接口应答中的返回码和返回信息详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710623908864\",\"title\":\"建站工具-建站复制\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uQvq86Xo\">通过此接口，用户可以实现站点的复制功能，成功后生成一个新站点id，站点内容和原站点一致。 <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">注意</code></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-denS8b9j\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4KcK6DEy\">用户在传入请求参数<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">site_ids</span></code>站点id列表时，需确保id的正确性，存在错误将导致复制全部失败！</li></ul>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201769949981137934%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-ie7wKPXE\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-SucDpkFE\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/site/copy/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/site/copy/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710623908864\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-D9llUxD3\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-j7F9zpau\">POST</p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-OTNK20KQ\" id=\"link-2\">请求Header</h5><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-TIBVGM5L\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-4PKl6Xk8\"><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-BUMA8gdO\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-MC8AklJk\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-eWgmYjZZ\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-8hDCIkeN\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ZmVH4mMB\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-TKB43jOd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mD64P2j1\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-kH7ZaXhP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WYNn8A6M\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-R5laGhSY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UTFJ04mP\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-KMcbaDeS\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-BeTBgGDN\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CKc3gaIU\">Content-Type<sp