 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取Access-Token】</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-eqcMwZUy\" id=\"link-3\">请求参数</h5><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-aQLbA6U2\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-719Xm11K\"><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-AEZomaBb\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-3CZCVOMI\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-j9cVnmMn\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-KYkQ5Mhf\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-oO9ea3VW\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-W39Q5VE6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DosxWL8v\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-PR575aYI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-J63lDdjT\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-bjYWXOCZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WsPtjrtm\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-gdNMSrdF\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-kBAFaUW1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bCWCky0Q\">advertiser_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-bdjJUYMQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ixW4sGHJ\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-KEMe6UNa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ly8nzx7L\">客户id，数字范围：1 &lt;= advertiser_id &lt;= <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">MAX_INT64</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-BsETJf6S\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-9K4kZh7k\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oxzcO9uj\">site_ids<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-l4KT69LX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0P9gU6FT\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-lkIXn7he\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lpT57Ley\">站点id列表, min_size=1, max_size=20</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-lbL9Lr8d\" id=\"link-4\">请求示例</h5><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22def%20updateStatusSite()%3A%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cnopen_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F%5C%22%5Cnuri%20%3D%20%5C%222%2Ftools%2Fsite%2Fcopy%2F%5C%22%5Cnurl%20%3D%20open_api_url_prefix%20%2B%20uri%5Cnparams%3D%7B%5Cn%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%5C%22site_ids%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5C%226859%5C%22%2C%5C%226996%5C%22%5D%5Cn%7D%5Cnheaders%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%7D%5Cnrsp%20%3D%20requests.post(url%2C%20json%3Dparams%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cnrsp_data%20%3D%20rsp.json()%5Cnreturn%20rsp_data%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22language%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22public%20JSONObject%20updateStatusSite()%20%7B%5CnString%20access_token%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%3B%5Cnfinal%20Long%20advertiser_id%20%3D%200L%3B%20%2F%2F%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BBid%5Cnfinal%20String%5B%5D%20site_ids%20%3D%20new%20string%5B%5D%20%7B%5C%22110%5C%22%2C%5C%22111%5C%22%7D%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5CnString%20open_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F2%2F%5C%22%3B%5CnString%20uri%20%3D%20%5C%22tools%2Fsite%2Fcopy%2F%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5CnMap%20data%20%3D%20new%20HashMap()%7B%5Cn%7B%5Cnput(%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%2Cadvertiser_id)%3B%5Cnput(%5C%22site_ids%5C%22%2Csite_ids)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%5CnHttpPost%20httpEntity%20%3D%20new%20HttpPost(open_api_url_prefix%20%2B%20uri)%3B%5Cn%5CnhttpEntity.setHeader(%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%2Caccess_token)%3B%5Cn%5CnCloseableHttpResponse%20response%20%3D%20null%3B%5CnCloseableHttpClient%20client%20%3D%20null%3B%5Cn%5Cntry%20%7B%5Cnclient%20%3D%20HttpClientBuilder.create().build()%3B%5CnhttpEntity.setEntity(new%20StringEntity(JSONObject.toJSONString(data)%2C%20ContentType.APPLICATION_JSON))%3B%5Cn%5Cnresponse%20%3D%20client.execute(httpEntity)%3